# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo is written on Windows but built on Linux (Render, Docker), so text files are
# stored with LF in the repository regardless of what the working copy uses. Without this,
# CRLF can leak into shell scripts and Dockerfiles and break the build with errors that
# look nothing like line-ending problems.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files genuinely require CRLF; cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.db binary
*.node binary
